	(text "Where the values come from (hidden fields Status / Note on every part say more):\n  K  known (drawing / owners' notes): VHT VHTR RH1 RH2 RH3\n  P  read from board photographs: C18 R15 C14 IC2 Q3 Q4 R24 C22 C21\n  E  estimate: L3 L4 D1 D2 D3 D4 R18 D5 D6 C17 Q1 Q2 C16 D9 C15 R17 R16 D7 D8 C12 C13 C10 C11 L1 L2 CR1 C20 IC1 C19 C23\nT1 (transformer box), fuses F1 / F2 and the mains side are not drawn; VHT1 / VHTR1 stand for the two secondaries.\nIC2 is an LF353N (both sections follow the same filtered reference VREF; Q4 feeds stage 1, Q3 stage 2 + followers)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 24.13 0)
